Check help output:

  $ sigal --help
  Usage: sigal [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
  
    Sigal - Simple Static Gallery Generator.
  
    Sigal is yet another python script to prepare a static gallery of images:
    resize images, create thumbnails with some options, generate html pages.
  
  Options:
    --version  Show the version and exit.
    --help     Show this message and exit.
  
  Commands:
    build        Run sigal to process a directory.
    export-epub  Export built photo album as EPUB ebook using photobook theme.
    init         Copy a sample config file in the current directory...
    serve        Run a simple web server.
    set-meta     Write metadata keys to .md file.
